research/audit/wave14-A3.md-61-   monotonicity, endpoint limits, and IVT.
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-62-9. `thm-exponential-beats-every-polynomial` — **APPROVE as recorded:**
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-63-   `ai-altered` / `ai-altered` / `semantic-source`. MIT proves exponential
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-64-   domination from a retained factorial-series term; the scaled and reciprocal
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-65-   two-limit version is a routine adaptation.
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-66-10. `thm-exponential-ivp-uniqueness` — **APPROVE as recorded:**
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-67-    `literature-derived` / `ai-altered` / `exact-source`. Hunter and Penn give
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-68-    the exact normalized ODE characterization; the integrating-factor proof is
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-69-    adapted.
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-70-11. `thm-normalized-exponential-functional-equation` — **APPROVE as recorded:**
research/audit/wave14-A3.md:71:    `ai-altered` / `ai-altered` / `semantic-source`. TAMU gives the normalized
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-72-    continuous positive multiplicative characterization and Johnson gives the
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-73-    continuous multiplicative exponential form; the item's two-part
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-74-    differentiability normalization is a combined package.
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-75-12. `lem-scaled-binomial-coefficients-converge` — **APPROVE WITH SOURCE
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-76-    AMENDMENT:** retain `ai-altered` / `ai-generated` / `semantic-source`, but
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-77-    add `https://aofa.cs.princeton.edu/40asymptotic/` to the ledger/reference
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-78-    evidence and revise the rationale. The submitted rationale itself admits
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-79-    that neither submitted source states the extracted fixed-`k` coefficient
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-80-    lemma. Princeton states, for fixed `k`,
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-81-    `binom(N,k)=N^k/k!(1+O(1/N))`, which is semantically the exact asserted
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-82-    limit. The displayed finite-product proof locally supplies the additional
research/audit/wave14-A3.md-83-    `[0,1/k!]` bound. This is source strengthening, not a classification change.
